    "planned_retirement values: W1b and W3 are the two recorded chains; 'unassigned' means no wave owns the edge yet.",
    "W3-0d (2026-08-25): a retired waiver row is MOVED here, not deleted. Each retired_waivers row keeps the waiver as it stood (from, to, class, reason, planned_retirement) and adds retired_wave, retired_head -- the commit that removed the edge, bound to history by scripts/lint_cluster_imports.py -- and retired_by_wrapper, the Legacy wrapper the edge now runs through or null when the edge was simply deleted. The two lists are a closed world over proof-status/cluster-import-edges.json: every forbidden pair of the frozen record appears in exactly one of them, and a retired pair whose edge is present again in the live tree is a lint failure. The Rigid221Placement -> TwoDeletionCollision retirement is linked to Erdos9796Proof.P97.ATail.FrontierLiveClosure.Legacy.TwoDeletionWrappers in both directions, through waiver_pair in proof-status/legacy-import-exceptions.json and through retired_by_wrapper here.",
    "W3-TA (2026-08-25): the Erdos9796Proof.P97.ATail.FrontierLiveClosure.TriApexEndpointRetainedOmission -> Erdos9796Proof.P97.ATail.FrontierLiveClosure.Rigid221Closure waiver is retired. The tri-apex module consumes one Rigid221 declaration, false_of_originalFrontierUniqueRadiusArm, and now reaches it through Erdos9796Proof.P97.ATail.FrontierLiveClosure.Legacy.Rigid221Wrappers, which is named back through waiver_pair in proof-status/legacy-import-exceptions.json, so the retirement and the wrapper are linked in both directions. The retired_head 09434d78 recorded here is the HEAD this retirement was authored against, not the wave commit, which does not exist yet; the receipt-only child commit of the wave commit rebinds it to the wave commit.",
    "W4 (2026-08-27): neutral interface extraction removes the FreshThirdPinnedFanPacket -> TriApexEndpointRetainedOmission edge outright and routes the TwoSourceCanonicalSurface -> TriApexEndpointRetainedOmission dependency through Erdos9796Proof.P97.ATail.FrontierLiveClosure.Legacy.TriApexWrappers. The wrapper is linked back to the retired pair through waiver_pair in proof-status/legacy-import-exceptions.json."
